{"id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-fo-tc.md","title":"传递闭包逻辑 FO(TC)","display":"df-fo-tc — 传递闭包逻辑 FO(TC)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-fo-tc","aliases":["29-df-fo-tc"],"display":"df-fo-tc — 传递闭包逻辑 FO(TC)","depends_on":["[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-tc]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-term]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-term-interpretation]]"],"source_locator":"§9.2, p.143, DjVu scan 158","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-fo-tc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-fo-tc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fo-tc — 传递闭包逻辑 FO(TC)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§9.2, p.143, DjVu scan 158"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 见所列语法依赖。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>生成规则中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x,\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\">\\(\\bar x,\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\)</span> 分量各异且彼此不交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar s,\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^k\">\\(\\bar s,\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^k\\)</span>；这些参数遍历所有合法取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>；FO 满足子句沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>，新子句按公式树递归。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}_V(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}_V(E)\\)</span> 取反身传递闭包，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}\\)</span> 同时作为该算子的语法及满足关系下标；其关系级接口是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}_V\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}_V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下核心递归中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\tau}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\)</span> 属于本条扩张公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；不是把带扩张子式的公式直接交给纯FO的满足函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>边关系子句中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau]\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x,\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\">\\(\\bar x,\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)|=2k\">\\(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)|=2k\\)</span>；其余自由变量保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 的值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T^{0,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T^{0,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T^{j+1,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathcal T^{j,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\phi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal T^{j,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\},\\ Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\}\\cup\\{[\\operatorname{TC}_{\\bar x,\\bar y}\\phi](\\bar s,\\bar t)\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal T^{j,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T^{j+1,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathcal T^{j,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\phi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal T^{j,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\},\\ Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\}\\cup\\{[\\operatorname{TC}_{\\bar x,\\bar y}\\phi](\\bar s,\\bar t)\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal T^{j,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T^{j,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T^{j,\\mathrm{TC}}_\\tau,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E^{\\phi,\\mathrm{TC}}_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\in(|A|^k)^2\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E^{\\phi,\\mathrm{TC}}_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\in(|A|^k)^2\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}[\\operatorname{TC}_{\\bar x,\\bar y}\\phi](\\bar s,\\bar t)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\bar s^A[\\beta],\\bar t^A[\\beta])\\in\\operatorname{TC}_{|A|^k}(E^{\\phi,\\mathrm{TC}}_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}[\\operatorname{TC}_{\\bar x,\\bar y}\\phi](\\bar s,\\bar t)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\bar s^A[\\beta],\\bar t^A[\\beta])\\in\\operatorname{TC}_{|A|^k}(E^{\\phi,\\mathrm{TC}}_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}([\\operatorname{TC}_{\\bar x,\\bar y}\\phi](\\bar s,\\bar t))\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)))\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}([\\operatorname{TC}_{\\bar x,\\bar y}\\phi](\\bar s,\\bar t))\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)))\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_{\\tau}(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(Qx\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_{\\tau}(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(Qx\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\alpha[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models\\alpha[\\beta],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\neg\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\alpha[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models\\alpha[\\beta],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\neg\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\phi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta]\\land A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\phi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta]\\lor A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\phi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta]\\land A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\phi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta]\\lor A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\phi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta]\\to A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\psi[\\beta])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\phi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta]\\to A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\psi[\\beta])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\phi[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §9.2，印刷页 143，扫描页 158。补齐变量组不交、自由参数保存和嵌套体语义。TC 可任意嵌套及否定；FO(pos TC) 是另一个限制片段，不能在未说明时与此语法混同。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"575d9a1532e3c73b","